+	 * or not (pa_awake). No reset or reload here any more. Android's stream start: hw_params (serial port, GLOBAL_FS,
+	 * set_sysclk), routing and enables, then the main amp up; with the firmware awake, PLAY to the mailbox
+	 * (cs35l43_dsp_audio_ev: 0x13020 <- 0x0B000001, AUDIO_STATE 1, 2, 6 or 7 within 2 ms is success), hold, PAUSE
+	 * (0x0B000002, AUDIO_STATE 0, 2 or 6). Not yet: the first-play steps that need this phone's calibration
+	 * (CAL_R_SEL, ALLOW_ACT_BOOT); the audio DSP sends silence.
